  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/04/CoronelDruida2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(50 fotos) El grupo de Onda Coronel Rock ha ofrecido un extraordinario concierto en dos sesiones en Druida Bar&amp;Drinks, en la calle Ausi&agrave;s March, 45,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/04/CoronelDruida1.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>la tarde y la noche del jueves 29 de marzo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidacoronel/img_5396.jpg\" alt=\"img_5396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidacoronel/img_5398.jpg\" alt=\"img_5398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidacoronel/img_5399.jpg\" alt=\"img_5399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidacoronel/img_5400.jpg\" alt=\"img_5400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidacoronel/img_5401.jpg\" alt=\"img_5401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidacoronel/img_5402.jpg\" alt=\"img_5402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidacoronel/img_5403.jpg\" alt=\"img_5403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidacoronel/img_5404.jpg\" alt=\"img_5404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/druidacoronel/img_5405.jpg\" alt=\"img_5405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4